  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build classrooms and latrines in Majak Goi village</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Mawoudit Foundation intends to build  8 classrooms and 16 pit latrine blocks at  Deng Maker Primary School in Majak Goi village, South Sudan to provide a conducive environment for learning to kids from humble backgrounds in Majak Goi village. The project will also provide free meals, and solar torches to 500 pupils and train 8 teachers at Deng Maker Primary School. With this project, we will introduce digital library for pupils and teachers by using tablet.</narrative>
  </description>
